  <div class="mt-6 max-w-3xl space-y-4 text-lg opacity-80">
    <p>These are real parts, scanned and delivered the way yours would be. Each page has an interactive 3D model you can rotate and zoom. Switch to wireframe to see the triangles that make up the mesh and how finely the surface has been captured.</p>
    <p>Every scan is a mesh of tiny triangles, saved as an STL or PLY file. Our laser scanner is accurate to ±0.2mm, so small features such as latches, buttons and screw threads come through. Pick an example to see how a part like yours looks once it is scanned.</p>
  </div>

